["Find out how it happened.  Examination shows that the child has suffered a greenstick fracture which will require a plaster cast and sling.","Explain
-	future growth should not be impaired;
-	approx. 6 weeks to heal;
-	all normal activities ok, within limitations of wearing plaster"]

["Ask about the history of the cut and treatment so far.","Recommend he/she seeks immediate medical attention.","Explain why this is necessary and outline signs and symptoms that the cut is worsening.","Explain that antibiotics/cream may be prescribed by a doctor.","Instruct on proper care of coral cuts for future reference:
- clean with fresh water;
- scrub to remove embedded coral particles;
- flush again with hydrogen peroxide in water and then water alone;
- apply local antibiotic powder;
- keep dry.","Insist that the client sees a doctor and avoids diving until the wound heals."]

